    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>护甲（重甲），非普通（需同调）</em><br>穿着这套护甲期间，你可以用其施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.o9GQEt4fYw6WjpB0]{死者交谈 Speak with Dead}</em>或是<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.xYpJGRI4xcMa41kO]{活化死尸 Animate Dead}</em>。以此施展了法术后，直到次日黎明为止这套护甲都无法再次被用于施展这两个法术。<br>这套盔甲会随着你灵魂的离去而消逝。若你在同调这套护甲期间死亡，这套护甲也将随之摧毁。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span class=\"GramE\">板甲由</span>覆盖全身，且相互连接的模铸金属板组成。一套<span class=\"GramE\">板甲包括</span>护手、重皮靴、一顶<span class=\"GramE\">附面甲</span>的头盔<span class=\"GramE\">以及在护甲</span>底层的厚重的布甲。其锁扣和皮带结构可以将护甲重量分配到身体各处。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can use it to cast either @spell[Speak with Dead] or @spell[Animate Dead]. Once the armor has cast a spell in this way, it can't cast either spell until the next dawn.</p><p>Your soul keeps this armor together. If you die while you are attuned to the armor, the armor is destroyed.</p><p>Plate consists of shaped, interlocking metal plates to cover the entire body. A suit of plate includes gauntlets, heavy leather boots, a visored helmet, and thick layers of padding underneath the armor. Buckles and straps distribute the weight over the body.</p></div>",
